  "description": "<p>TimeMaps have a specific URI of fedora:timemap, but we address them via the /fcr:versions URI.</p>\n\n<p>ie. a GET returns triples<br/>\n&lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/versionableObject/fedora:timemap\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/versionableObject/fedora:timemap</a>&gt; a fedora:Resource</p>\n\n<p>this should be<br/>\n&lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/versionableObject/fcr:versions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/versionableObject/fcr:versions</a>&gt; a fedora:Resource</p>\n\n<p>This task builds on the work of \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-2623\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-2623\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Support HEAD / GET on LDPCv\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10300?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-2623\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n to create a converter to change this URI.</p>",
